            "review_title": "Review at Fryday's Fish & Chips",
            "review_text": "Nick C\nYerevan, Armenia21 contributions\n0\nBritish Fish and Chips on the otherside of the world!\nDec 2019\nI bloomin' love Fryday's Fish and Chips. On a soggy night when the damp is entering your bones, what better way to bring a smile to you face than Fish and Chips. The Fish and Chips are both crispy on the outside, yet tasty and succulent in the middle. When I go back to the UK, I will normally eat about half my meals out at fish and chip shops. What they've done here is a miracle in these foreign climes.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 5, 2020",
